Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["01-GWPPARAM", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 
   3.996753019402701*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0e258174-d65d-441d-932c-\
c3dd0bb05990"],

Cell["\<\
The 01-GWPPARAM test suite verifies the foundational data-routing integrity \
of the framework. It systematically proves that the GWPPARAM constructor \
correctly parses its overloaded positional arguments and successfully hands \
them off to the underlying GWP486 parameter engine. By evaluating a wide \
range of input configurations\[LongDash]from partial, single-parameter \
definitions to fully specified states with custom rule-based options\
\[LongDash]these tests guarantee that the parameter bus robustly validates, \
formats, and transmits user inputs to the core physics engine without data \
loss or assignment errors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996753975952414*^9},ExpressionUUID->"c24553e7-9815-4a52-bc6c-\
8024eb643f8c"],

