3cae3c03a088"],

Cell["\<\
The 03-GWPPARSE test suite verifies the robustness of the framework\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s user-input processing capabilities. It establishes that \
the parsing functions correctly interpret various flexible input formats, \
reliably decomposing them into the strict real and imaginary components \
required by the internal parameter bus. Furthermore, the suite thoroughly \
tests the system\[CloseCurlyQuote]s error-handling architecture by \
intentionally supplying invalid inputs to ensure they are safely intercepted \
and generate the appropriate diagnostic warning messages.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996754408563643*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3193670b-ab2b-4d06-b146-\
6624d98643aa"],

