Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["05-GWP486", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.9967536878661537`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"76a2b1d1-f181-43b3-8769-\
3845747cc0ef"],

Cell["\<\
The 05-GWP486 test suite validates the core computational logic of the GWP486 \
parameter engine. Utilizing the previously verified extractor functions, the \
suite evaluates the engine\[CloseCurlyQuote]s ability to correctly parse \
complex inputs and construct the fundamental parameter bus. It systematically \
proves that the engine accurately derives the necessary real-valued \
parameters\[LongDash]such as the translated position, momentum, phase \
components, and normalization constant\[LongDash]while strictly persisting \
foundational constants like mass, Planck\[CloseCurlyQuote]s constant, \
potential coefficients, and the initial input variables.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996754869208313*^9},ExpressionUUID->"923886c8-ad1b-4949-a41d-\
5c04ed7a5d42"],

