Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["09-GWPDENSITY", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.996753721448414*^9},ExpressionUUID->"b4b4cfbd-ae58-4ed7-a7a9-\
c7cd239c196c"],

Cell["\<\
The 09-GWPDENSITY test suite validates the framework\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
probability density functions across position, momentum, and energy spaces. \
In both position and momentum space, the suite confirms that the explicitly \
coded analytical density derivatives match standard symbolic differentiation \
up to the sixth order. It also verifies through continuous integration that \
these densities strictly achieve unit normalization and accurately recover \
the expected position and momentum centroid values. Additionally, the suite \
rigorously evaluates the energy space density by performing complex branch \
cut validations, ensuring exact mathematical normalization across varying \
parameter assumption states.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9967557477334967`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"00409c8b-b6e2-4a20-97e6-\
eef83e48916f"],

