Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["10-GWPCDF", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.996753731910015*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1efddb00-d56d-4360-98e0-\
c6d487b0b2d5"],

Cell["\<\
The 10-GWPCDF test suite verifies the mathematical properties and functional \
forms of the cumulative distribution functions (CDFs) across position, \
momentum, and energy spaces. The suite confirms that these functions satisfy \
strict asymptotic boundary conditions, ensuring they correctly bound the \
cumulative probability between zero and one at the respective spatial and \
energy limits. Furthermore, it validates the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus \
by proving that the explicit analytical derivatives of the CDFs perfectly \
recover their corresponding probability density functions. Finally, the tests \
evaluate the interval probability functions to guarantee exact unit \
normalization when integrated over the full physical domains.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996755904602223*^9},ExpressionUUID->"e7e3474f-8b31-47b8-b385-\
afe7c4c91d5b"],

