Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13-GWPHYDRODYNAMICSP", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.996753758938923*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1681a238-3bdc-4f42-a16d-\
771ca70727db"],

Cell["\<\
The 13-GWPHYDRODYNAMICSP test suite extends this rigorous hydrodynamic \
validation into momentum space. Unlike the integration tests, this suite \
successfully employs a fully generalized, unwrapped parameter sequence \
featuring complex position and momentum inputs to prove the robustness of the \
algebraic representations. It confirms that the momentum-space mappings of \
the amplitude, phase, spatial coordinates, and flow velocities are \
analytically correct. Additionally, it verifies the explicit mathematical \
formulations for the momentum-space current density, quantum potential, \
quantum stress, and the corresponding decompositions of information and \
energy densities.\
