Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14-GWPTRAJECTORY", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.996753767968089*^9},ExpressionUUID->"6dac2fb2-3695-482c-bed8-\
ffceca46f403"],

Cell["\<\
The 14-GWPTRAJECTORY test suite verifies that the explicitly encoded Bohmian \
trajectory fields correctly function as the exact analytical inverses of both \
the position-space and momentum-space cumulative distribution functions \
(CDFs). The suite systematically proves that the internally coded derivatives \
for these trajectory fields perfectly match standard symbolic differentiation \
up to the sixth order. Furthermore, it rigorously guarantees mathematical \
consistency across coordinate representations by confirming that all \
explicitly mapped C-space (cumulative space) hydrodynamic constructs\
\[LongDash]including amplitude, phase, flow velocities, quantum potentials, \
and various energy densities\[LongDash]analytically reproduce their \
position-space counterparts evaluated at the trajectory boundary.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996757300894429*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ecb1a443-85f5-48ed-9047-\
070120aae83b"],

