Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["15-GWPOBJECT-INTERFACE", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.99675377733738*^9},ExpressionUUID->"11bde2f9-7db8-40a1-8146-\
7a38df41b259"],

Cell["\<\
The 15-GWPOBJECT-INTERFACE test suite rigorously evaluates the overarching \
architectural integrity and user-facing introspection capabilities of the GWP \
and GWPObject symbols. It first verifies that the fundamental object \
constructor properly initializes state metadata and correctly handles default \
parameters. The tests then systematically validate the framework\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Tier-1 introspection layer, ensuring exact structural \
parity between the static GWP environment and instantiated objects while \
confirming the programmatic discoverability of internal dictionaries, \
property classes, and available potential models. Finally, the suite \
thoroughly tests the exhaustive routing logic and error-handling \
architecture, proving that invalid queries and unsupported property requests \
safely resolve to fallbacks and generate the appropriate diagnostic messages.\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996757471115365*^9},ExpressionUUID->"fc2ad7b5-c3df-46bb-a18f-\
e0b260af06e0"],

