Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["16-GWPDISPATCH", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.996753786588633*^9},ExpressionUUID->"b71fe02c-3e07-45c9-994f-\
c4b1ef00d9d0"],

Cell["\<\
The 16-GWPDISPATCH test suite verifies the framework\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
Tier-3 object dispatching architecture by confirming that user-level property \
queries are accurately routed to the underlying low-level GWPTools \
mathematical functions. To guarantee exhaustive coverage, the suite is \
algorithmically generated directly from the package\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
internal function registries, systematically mapping out every available \
query. It evaluates these routings under both dynamic conditions (where an \
explicit time-dependent potential is active) and static conditions (where the \
wavepacket evaluates without a potential). Furthermore, it rigorously tests \
the system\[CloseCurlyQuote]s execution logic by ensuring that physical \
properties strictly requiring a dynamic potential safely trigger the \
appropriate fallback errors when queried on a static object.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9967578592316093`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1ad09488-50b7-4551-903a-\
68745bce6be7"],

